# AegisFlow AI — user crontab for the `aegisflow` account.
#
# Install:   crontab deploy/aegisflow.crontab
# Inspect:   crontab -l
#
# This is the committed source of truth for the scheduled job. The app is
# served straight from this git checkout, and the wrapper script it calls
# lives in the same checkout, so "installed" == "committed" — nothing to
# drift (unlike deploy/aegisflow.service). If you edit this file, re-run
# `crontab deploy/aegisflow.crontab`.
#
# ── Windows Endpoint Analyzer (feature Part 3) ────────────────────────────
# Correlate recent Windows endpoint events and AI-triage the flagged
# clusters, every 10 minutes. Host cron chosen over a systemd timer
# deliberately (see deploy/cron-triage-endpoint-events.sh). All output goes
# to logs/triage-endpoint-events.log; the wrapper flock-guards overlap.
MAILTO=""
*/10 * * * * /home/aegisflow/app/deploy/cron-triage-endpoint-events.sh
